1.0.1 2026-10-14
  - Added stimuli/stimuli.tsv and stimuli.json (one row per clip already in stimuli/; no media added).
  - Added a stim_id column to the EEG and MEG task-action events (clip per 'video on' event, from derivatives/detailed_events where it identifies exactly one clip, n/a otherwise; joins stimuli/stimuli.tsv) and its description in each run's events.json.
  - README: section 'Stimuli'.
  - .bidsignore: datacite.yml (not a BIDS file; bids-validator NOT_INCLUDED error).
  - dataset_description.json: Funding entry 3 had manuscript line numbers inside the text ('2030-436', 'China437'); corrected to the wording of the Acknowledgements field. GeneratedBy entry for this enrichment.
  - Added code/check_stim_id.py: recomputes every stim_id from derivatives/detailed_events and stimuli/stimuli.tsv
    (files of this dataset only). On this version: 41,760 'video on' rows, 40,388 identified, 1,372 n/a (same YouTube
    video cut at several start times), 0 differences.
  - stimuli.json: the rights description said 'not included'; the clips are in stimuli/, deposited by the authors.
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 1.0.1.

